  "body": "Runtime audit follow-up from production logs. Adds adaptive worker-slot capacity based on host physical-memory pressure, lowers default concurrent catalog scans from 3 to 2 with less scheduler churn, and treats persistent human-verification timeout as a protective per-bot session cooldown instead of relaunching Chromium every minute. Active jobs are never killed during downscale.",
